  "body": "Stacked on #2264 (#2248, #2249). Retarget this PR to `main` before #2264 merges.\n\n## What changed\n\n- New `crates/ui/src/pick_line_memo.rs`. `interact::selection_feature_lines` reads the violet pick lines from it. One miss runs the old build (`feature_lines`) one time. A hit returns the shared `Arc<[[f32; 6]]>`.\n- The key is the input itself (rule 2 of `docs/decisions/2238-frame-cost-rule.md`), never `doc_version`:\n  - the shown pick list, by value;\n  - the pick ink;\n  - the vertex cross arm, only when a vertex is picked;\n  - for each picked model: the display-off flag, the entity, the `Arc<Features>` allocation and the view pose.\n- `pick_line_builds()` counts the real builds. `selection_feature_lines_fresh` (test only) builds without the memo.\n- The probe `frame_cost_probe` collects the scene one time before its window. The shell does this on the first frame of an input; the harness does not. The probe asserts `pick_lines` = 0 on still frames.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/2250-pick-overlay-lines.md`.\n\n## Safety\n\nThe lines are display only. No generator, check or post reads them. No cut geometry, chain or golden changed.\n\n## Readings (release, fig8, `frame_cost_probe::still`, ms per still frame, whole stack #2254, #2255, #2259, #2264, #2266)\n\n| State | Before (#2238) | After | `selection_features` after |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| a nothing selected | 3.5 | 3.8 | 0.012 |\n| b contour, top chains | 13.1 | 5.1 | 0.013 |\n| c 2D Adaptive, welded face, preview | 30.0 | 6.0 | 0.012 (was 1.48) |\n| d toolpath shown | 3.3 | 3.6 | 0.002 |\n| e simulation paused | 3.4 | 4.1 | 0.003 |\n\nThe a, d and e values are in the run-to-run noise. The largest remaining piece is `ui/viewport.pick_ink` in state c (0.91 ms). It is not in the scope of #2250.\n\nTest build (not launched): `.claude/tmp/test-builds/camcraft-framecost-fd68dfd90.exe`.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_caches::pick_lines_build_once_per_input`. Still frames build nothing. Each answer equals a fresh build after: a new pick, a hidden model, a move of fig8, and each undo.\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_probe::still_frames_on_fig8_name_their_costs`: `pick_lines` = 0 in states a-e.\n\n## Gate\n\n- `camcraft-ui` lib: 972 passed, 6 ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `main` is red in `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs` (E0063: missing fields `stepdown` and `stepover` in `CuttingRow`). This PR does not touch `camcraft-app`.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- A theme change and a change of the active setup with picks shown (the key holds the ink and the view pose, but no test changes them).\n- The setup-page drafts (plane, points, axis, locate) through the memo. They use the same function and the same key.\n\nChangelog: Performance: the viewport no longer outlines the picked faces and edges again on each frame.\n\nEffort: medium (no escalation).\n\nFixes #2250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n",
